<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight and one-week rates up.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight and one-week rates up.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian pound overnight interbank rates were up on Sunday in a short private sector market to between 10 1/4 and 10 3/8 percent against 10 and 10 1/8 percent on Thursday, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates on the pound were between 10 3/8 and 10 7/16 percent from 10 1/4 and 10 1/8 percent on Thursday.</p>
<p>Public-sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
